cription":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":2666708289,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNjY2NzA4Mjg5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:3d","name":"topic:3d","color":"ffee88","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"state":"open","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":8,"created_at":"2026-01-28T22:11:00Z","updated_at":"2026-02-06T12:52:55Z","closed_at":null,"assignee":null,"author_association":"NONE","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"### Tested versions\n\nReproducible in Godot 4.6\nDid not manage to reproduce in Godot 4.5.1 \n\n### System information\n\nWindows 10, D3D12, RTX 4080\n\n### Issue description\n\nWhen SSR is enabled, I can see an object with transparency mode set to alpha reflecting on another object if there is a third object between them (See the MRP)\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\nEnable SSR in a WorldEnvironment node\nAdd  a mesh with material that uses alpha (1)\nAdd  a mesh with material that has low roughness (2)\nAdd a mesh between them (3)\nMove mesh 3 while looking at 2 and you will see the color of mesh 1 reflecting \n\n<img width=\"3834\" height=\"2099\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/bbdb3f5a-39b1-4201-b719-7436499fcbe7\" />\n\n<img width=\"3840\" height=\"2160\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/4428d545-9a7c-495f-a369-0317ebaa9138\" />\n\n<img width=\"2170\" height=\"1464\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/9305c910-be8f-491a-aafb-647b10b16a24\" />\n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\n[SSR-MRP.zip](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/24922517/SSR-MRP.zip)\n\nTry to move the object named \"frame\" into the glowing cube while looking on the mirror cube. Try different angles. You will see that there is glow reflecting on the mirror even when the glowing material is set to alpha\n\nEdit: the MRP was modified to use different colors","closed_by":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/115541/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/115541/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null,"pinned_comment":null}